@startuml US006_SD
autonumber 37
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

actor "User" as Actor
participant "Frontend" as UI
participant ":JWT Authentication Filter" as Auth
participant ":CustomRecipeController" as Ctrl
participant ":CustomRecipeApplicationService" as Service
participant ":CustomRecipe" as Recipe
participant ":CustomRecipeRepository" as Repo
participant ":CustomRecipeMapper" as Mapper
participant ":DailyLogController (US004)" as LogCtrl

activate Actor
activate UI

== Browse saved recipes through US003 ==
Actor -> UI : opens food catalog browsing
UI --> Actor : offers open food catalog or personal recipes
Actor -> UI : chooses personal recipes
note over Actor, UI
    Choosing the open catalog continues the existing US003 search flow.
end note
UI -> Auth : GET /api/recipes?page=0&size=20\nAuthorization: Bearer <access-token>
activate Auth
Auth -> Ctrl : forward request with authenticated userId
activate Ctrl
deactivate Auth
Ctrl -> Service : listRecipes(userId, page, size)
activate Service
Service -> Repo : findByUserId(userId, page, size)
activate Repo
Repo --> Service : page of saved recipes
deactivate Repo
Service -> Mapper : toPageResponseDTO(recipes)
activate Mapper
Mapper --> Service : recipe page response
deactivate Mapper
Service --> Ctrl : recipe page response
deactivate Service
Ctrl --> UI : 200 OK + saved recipes
deactivate Ctrl
UI --> Actor : displays saved recipes

Actor -> UI : selects recipe for details
UI -> Auth : GET /api/recipes/{recipeId}\nAuthorization: Bearer <access-token>
activate Auth
Auth -> Ctrl : forward authenticated userId and recipeId
activate Ctrl
deactivate Auth
Ctrl -> Service : getRecipe(userId, recipeId)
activate Service
Service -> Repo : findByIdAndUserId(recipeId, userId)
activate Repo
Repo --> Service : owned CustomRecipe with ingredients and macros
deactivate Repo
Service -> Mapper : toResponseDTO(recipe)
activate Mapper
Mapper --> Service : CustomRecipeResponseDTO
deactivate Mapper
Service --> Ctrl : CustomRecipeResponseDTO
deactivate Service
Ctrl --> UI : 200 OK + saved recipe details
deactivate Ctrl
UI --> Actor : displays ingredients, serving count, total and per-serving nutrition

== Log a saved recipe through US004 ==
Actor -> UI : chooses to add food in today's log
UI --> Actor : offers open food catalog or personal recipes
Actor -> UI : chooses personal recipes
ref over Actor, Service
    Reuse the personal recipe list and detail selection above.
end ref
Actor -> UI : selects meal type and number of recipe servings
UI -> Auth : POST /api/daily-log/today/recipe-items\n(body: recipeId, mealType, quantity)\nAuthorization: Bearer <access-token>
activate Auth
Auth -> LogCtrl : forward request with authenticated userId
activate LogCtrl
deactivate Auth
ref over LogCtrl, LogCtrl
    US004: addRecipeMealItem(userId, request) resolves the owner's saved recipe,
    map per-serving nutrition into a DailyLog FoodSnapshot,
    add the meal item and save today's log.
end ref
LogCtrl --> UI : 200 OK + updated DailyLogResponseDTO
deactivate LogCtrl
UI --> Actor : displays logged recipe and updated daily progress

deactivate UI
deactivate Actor
@enduml
